    "title": "Introducing 𝗕𝗘𝗨𝗧𝗘𝗔 𝗕𝗜𝗧𝗘𝗦 ",
    "venue": "",
    "dateStart": "2026-04-23T16:00:00.000Z",
    "dateEnd": "2026-12-30T16:00:00.000Z",
    "slug": "introducing-2026-05-05-6009",
    "keywords": "",
    "displayStart": "2026-04-23T16:00:00.000Z",
    "description": "🍞🍠 𝗜𝗡𝗧𝗥𝗢𝗗𝗨𝗖𝗜𝗡𝗚 𝗕𝗘𝗨𝗧𝗘𝗔 𝗕𝗜𝗧𝗘𝗦, 𝗔𝗩𝗔𝗜𝗟𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘 𝗙𝗥𝗢𝗠 𝟮𝟰 𝗔𝗣𝗥 (𝗙𝗥𝗜) 🔥\n\nSIP & SNACK! Now serving all-new 𝗣𝗿𝗲𝘁𝘇𝗲𝗹 𝗖𝗿𝗼𝘂𝘁𝗼𝗻𝘀 🍞 and 𝗬𝗮𝗺 𝗖𝗵𝗶𝗽𝘀 🍠 made to pair perfectly with your favourite tea!\n\n🍞 𝗣𝗿𝗲𝘁𝘇𝗲𝗹 𝗖𝗿𝗼𝘂𝘁𝗼𝗻𝘀 🍞\nOven-baked to golden perfection, cut into bite-sized pieces and baked for a light, airy and satisfyingly crispy crunch!\n\nAvailable in 3 addictive flavours:\n🍮🧂 𝘾𝙖𝙧𝙖𝙢𝙚𝙡 𝙎𝙚𝙖𝙨𝙖𝙡𝙩 \n🧈🧄 𝘽𝙪𝙩𝙩𝙚𝙧𝙮 𝙂𝙖𝙧𝙡𝙞𝙘 \n🫕🧀 𝘾𝙧𝙚𝙖𝙢 𝘾𝙝𝙚𝙚𝙨𝙚\n🍠 𝗬𝗮𝗺 𝗖𝗵𝗶𝗽𝘀 🍠\n\nFresh yam is thinly sliced to achieve a perfectly crisp, golden crunch. Each chip is thin, crunchy and full of flavour!\n\nAvailable in 2 bold flavours:\n🍅 𝙏𝙤𝙢𝙖𝙩𝙤 \n🌶️ 𝙏𝙚𝙣𝙜𝙟𝙞𝙖𝙤 𝙋𝙚𝙥𝙥𝙚𝙧 𝙎𝙥𝙞𝙘𝙮\n\n📣 𝗔𝗽𝗽 & 𝗜𝗻-𝘀𝘁𝗼𝗿𝗲 𝗘𝘅𝗰𝗹𝘂𝘀𝗶𝘃𝗲 𝗕𝘂𝗻𝗱𝗹𝗲\nPair your snack with 1 Large White Peach Oolong / Jasmine Green / Wuyi Da Hong Pao Milk Tea and enjoy:\n🥨 Pretzel Croutons at only RM2.90 (West Malaysia)\n🍠 Yam Chips at only RM3.90 (West Malaysia)\n\nSweet? Savoury? Spicy? We’ve got you covered 😋🔥\n\n📍 BEUTEA at Lot G-13A & G-13B, Ground Floor\n\n#BEUTEA #BEUTEAMY #BEUTEABITES #PretzelCroutons #YamChips #SunwayKluangMall",
