    "displayStart": "2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z",
    "description": "☕️ 𝗔𝗹𝗹-𝗡𝗲𝘄 𝗖𝗼𝗳𝗳𝗲𝗲 𝗦𝗲𝗿𝗶𝗲𝘀 𝗕𝗿𝗲𝘄𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗳𝗿𝗼𝗺 𝟮𝟭 𝗦𝗲𝗽 (𝗠𝗼𝗻)! 🤎\n\n🎉 BEUTEA, now beyond tea! Get ready to discover our all-new Coffee Series, crafted with a precisely curated 100% Arabica blend from 3 distinct origins for every coffee moment. ☕️🤎 Roasted, smooth and aromatic, with:�🌸 Ethiopia Yirgacheffe — bright floral notes�🍫 Brazil — smooth, chocolatey body�🍊 Colombia — balanced depth and a gentle citrus finish\n\n�🤎 𝗟𝗶𝗺𝗶𝘁𝗲𝗱 𝗧𝗶𝗺𝗲 𝗖𝗼𝗳𝗳𝗲𝗲 𝗦𝗲𝗿𝗶𝗲𝘀 ☕️: \n☕️🌿 𝗕𝗹𝗮𝗰𝗸 𝗧𝗲𝗮 𝗖𝗵𝗮𝗺 𝗟𝗮𝘁𝘁𝗲\n☕️🥥 𝗖𝗼𝗰𝗼𝗻𝘂𝘁 𝗟𝗮𝘁𝘁𝗲\n☕️🍓 𝗦𝘁𝗿𝗮𝘄𝗯𝗲𝗿𝗿𝘆 𝗖𝗹𝗼𝘂𝗱 𝗟𝗮𝘁𝘁𝗲 \n☕️🍪 𝗢𝗿𝗲𝗼 𝗖𝗹𝗼𝘂𝗱 𝗟𝗮𝘁𝘁𝗲\n\n✨ 𝙇𝙞𝙢𝙞𝙩𝙚𝙙 𝙀𝙙𝙞𝙩𝙞𝙤𝙣 𝘿𝙚𝙣𝙞𝙢 𝙈𝙚𝙧𝙘𝙝𝙖𝙣𝙙𝙞𝙨𝙚✨:\n📌 Week 1 (Available from 21 Sep, Mon)\n\n💝 𝗙𝗥𝗘𝗘 𝗟𝗶𝗺𝗶𝘁𝗲𝗱 𝗘𝗱𝗶𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝗦𝘁𝗶𝗰𝗸𝗲𝗿\nReceive 1 FREE Sticker Sheet with the purchase of any 1 Coffee Series drink (While stock lasts)\n🩵 𝗗𝗲𝗻𝗶𝗺 𝗟𝗮𝗻𝘆𝗮𝗿𝗱 𝗕𝘂𝗻𝗱𝗹𝗲\nGet 1 Denim Lanyard from RM19.90 with the purchase of any 1 Coffee Series drink! (Free sticker while stock lasts)\n💙 𝗗𝗲𝗻𝗶𝗺 𝗣𝗼𝘂𝗰𝗵 𝗕𝘂𝗻𝗱𝗹𝗲 \nGet 1 Denim Pouch from RM9.90 with purchase of any 1 Coffee Series drink! (Free sticker while stock lasts)\n\n📌 𝗪𝗲𝗲𝗸 𝟮 (𝗔𝘃𝗮𝗶𝗹𝗮𝗯𝗹𝗲 𝗳𝗿𝗼𝗺 𝟮𝟴 𝗦𝗲𝗽, 𝗠𝗼𝗻)\n💝 𝗙𝗥𝗘𝗘 𝗟𝗶𝗺𝗶𝘁𝗲𝗱 𝗘𝗱𝗶𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝗣𝘂𝘇𝘇𝗹𝗲 𝗦𝘁𝗶𝗰𝗸𝗲𝗿\nReceive 1 FREE Puzzle Sticker with the purchase of any 2 Coffee Series drink (While stock lasts)\n🩵 𝗗𝗲𝗻𝗶𝗺 𝗖𝗵𝗮𝗿𝗺 𝗕𝘂𝗻𝗱𝗹𝗲\nGet 1 Denim Charm from RM11.90 with the purchase of any 1 Coffee Series drink! (Free sticker while stock lasts)\n💙𝗗𝗲𝗻𝗶𝗺 𝗕𝗮𝗴 𝗕𝘂𝗻𝗱𝗹𝗲 \nGet 1 Denim Bag from RM16.90 with purchase of any 1 Coffee Series drink! (Free sticker while stock lasts)\n🏷️ 𝙇𝙞𝙢𝙞𝙩𝙚𝙙 𝙏𝙞𝙢𝙚 𝙋𝙧𝙤𝙢𝙤\n🔥 RM7.90 Coconut Latte when you order via BEUTEA App!\n\n⏳ Limited stocks available! \n\nDon’t miss out — all-new Coffee Series and limited-edition denim merch are arriving from 𝟮𝟭 𝗦𝗲𝗽 (𝗠𝗼𝗻)! 🤎☕️\n\n📌 Please check the comment for Terms & Conditions.\n\n#BEUTEA #BEUTEAMY #BeuteaCoffee #MalaysianBrand #CoffeeSeries",
